    "_postman_id": "6e6a3edd-e15b-45bd-9201-bea4f7483058",
    "name": "Subtrack Interview",
    "description": "**Subtrack mono** is a monolithic REST API collection for a subscription tracking application. It covers the full backend surface of the platform, organized into five functional modules:\n\n- **Auth** — User registration and login endpoints for managing authentication.\n- **User** — Endpoints for retrieving, updating user profiles, roles, and passwords.\n- **Subscription** — Full CRUD operations for subscriptions, including status management (active, paused, cancelled) and renewal workflows (due subscriptions, renew).\n- **Payments** — Payment processing and retrieval, covering individual payments, payments by subscription, and full transaction history per user.\n- **Notification** — Notification lifecycle management: create, read, mark as read (single or all), get unread count, and delete notifications.\n\nUse this collection to develop, test, and validate the end-to-end flows of the Subtrack platform from authentication through to payment and notification handling.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "57478474"
  },
